/****** UP-Scroller.mcc/UPA_Scroller_First ******
*
*   NAME
*       UPA_Scroller_First -- attribute of UP-Scroller.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       LONG: first visible entry (notifies)
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPA_Scroller_First - access ISG. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Read with GetAttr/get(), set with SetAttrs/set() or in the MUI_NewObject tag list, as the access letters allow (I = initial, S = set, G = get).
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-Scroller.mcc
*
******/

